# Copied into the website at build time. Anyone who opens the site can read it.
# Copy this file to client/.env. Leave the value empty for local development.
#
# A pilot build (PILOT_REQUIRE_SUPPORT=1, set on the server host) refuses to
# build until this is a real support route: an email, a phone number, or a
# short instruction such as "Ask the facilitator".
# Do not invent a number. Do not put an API key here.
VITE_SUPPORT_CONTACT=
